␀␀␀␀(bit_start_in_reg + bit_count_used_in_reg) <= 32␀␀␀␀//IDF/components/efuse/src/esp_efuse_utility.c␀␀blk >= 0 && blk < EFUSE_BLK_MAX␀num_reg <= (range_read_addr_blocks[blk].end - range_read_addr_blocks[blk].start) / sizeof(uint32_t)␀efuse␀␀␀E (%lu) %s: Range of data does not match the coding scheme
